# The CMS edits v1 into v2 without publishing, then unpublishes v2: we never saw v2 published,
# but the unPublish carries its fields, so v2 is stored, not Visible.
@run = 1
@id = unseen-{{run}}

### Publish v1
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{cmsUsername}} {{cmsPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "type": "publish", "id": "{{id}}", "version": 1, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T10:00:00Z", "payload": { "title": "v1" } }
]

### unPublish v2, a version never published: applies with the v2 fields
POST {{host}}/cms/events
Authorization: Basic {{cmsUsername}} {{cmsPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "type": "unPublish", "id": "{{id}}", "version": 2, "timestamp": "2026-01-01T11:00:00Z", "payload": { "title": "v2 draft" } }
]

### User: 404, not Visible
GET {{host}}/entities/{{id}}
Authorization: Basic {{readerUsername}} {{readerPassword}}

### Admin: version 2, title "v2 draft", isPublished false
GET {{host}}/entities/{{id}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminUsername}} {{adminPassword}}
